00:02:23.670 --> 00:02:25.950
And when we talk about
Soft Landing Summer,

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:27.570
this is what we're talking about.

00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:28.740
Now, this is comparing to

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:29.573
