00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.740
but just slow down

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.600
to a slower increase,

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:04.830
a slower pace of increase.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:07.080
So retail sales still picking up

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.460
on a year-over-year basis.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.410
But again, this just illustrating

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.450
that we are seeing this slowdown,

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:15.450
and again what I'm terming
Soft Landing Summer.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:16.320
If you hear that anywhere else,

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:17.370
