in terms of what it means

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:35.640
for the Federal Reserve.

00:04:35.640 --> 00:04:38.040
So we saw spending online continuing,

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.780
really leading all categories

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.870
for the monthly gain of
1.9% month-over-month,

