00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.120
We are seeing services inflation,

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.890
as in what you're paying for services,

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:06.060
like when you go out to a bar

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:06.893
