numbers really take off.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.420
We saw the latest University

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.850
of Michigan Consumer Sentiment Index push

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:40.770
way above expectations,

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:42.150
