00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.910
and that was down 1.4% month-over-month,

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.250
22.7% year-over-year.

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.140
So gas station revenue really just,

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.970
boo, diving lower.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.140
and again, that's not good

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:59.400
