00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:01.260
but that's great for the average person

00:07:01.260 --> 00:07:02.670
who's gotta fill up the truck

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:03.503
to get to work,

00:07:03.503 --> 00:07:05.370
or fill up the car to get to work,

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.420
and they're spending less

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:08.070
