00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:12.690
Sporting goods, hobby, musical instrument,

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:13.530
and some books,

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.390
those down one percent month-over-month,

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.860
about 1.3% year-over-year.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.500
Building materials, garden
supplies, also down.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.140
The big picture here is
goods versus services.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.640
We know that goods are falling

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.440
because we're just not spending as much,

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.730
