00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:52.650
So good prices, declining;

00:07:52.650 --> 00:07:53.940
Services, holding up.

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:57.000
And that's holding those
retail sales numbers

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.790
above flat, above zero,

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:01.177
